[[0,1292639,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-17T13:17:09","Gaffots","",[],"","Fake twitter stories about cops.","http://www.neogaf.com/forum/showthread.php?t=1279998","NeoFAG"],[1,6341222,0,2,0,2,"2016-09-17T13:31:25","Tom_Bradys_Vagina","[e]",[],"<p>A hot &quot;black&quot; girl selling wigs. This is a new low even for GAF. She's hot in that wig though. I'd let her peg me.</p>"],[1,6341391,0,0,0,0,"2016-09-17T14:06:22","BillBugle","",[],"<p>1 how would she know how long he was in a police station? 2 why would the officer divulge what was said during an ongoing case? 3 why is there no proof of this? </p>\n<p>all seems very odd, 2 hours wouldn't have been long enough to even get a free lawyer there to sit in while the police questioned him</p>"],[1,6341678,0,0,0,0,"2016-09-17T14:55:05","FairyOriginal","",[],"<p>I would think that with ALL the real horrendous cop stories out there people don't need to fake anything. Then again I've also read some incredulous stories about people faking all kinds of things and the reason they do it, ... is for the attention. See all the sympathy it rendered ? Don't like the police - adds more fuel to that hate cause while supporting fakers cause. </p>\n<p>It really could have been anything IF this story is indeed fake. I mean our news stations air fake news stories all time except they refer to them as <em>edited</em> same thing goes for newspapers. Of course, there are many tragic real horror stories that are often neglected by not only the police, the media but also the courts that deserve the attention they never received. </p>\n<p>The voices across many social media platforms is one of a condescending anger that seems to infiltrate into every discussion regardless of the subject, regardless of the country. I'm watching it escalate before my very eyes. Some think censorship is the solution ... it never is. Justice was once viewed as a solution but that too has failed terribly and become nothing more than a mockery. Protests all over the world over inhumane treatments, poverty, racial divides, corruption and ... you name it are happening more frequently and have become more violent. Wars <em>on everything under the sun</em> has infucted the internet and translates to ... war on everyone. So yah, sip sip. </p>"],[1,6342118,0,0,0,0,"2016-09-17T16:22:56","Bruce_Jenners_Balls","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>I have no idea if this is true or not</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Proceeds to post story that fits the gaf narrative.</p>"],[1,6342375,0,0,0,0,"2016-09-17T17:04:14","shitIord","",[],"<p>these trannies have all the luck</p>"],[1,6342771,0,0,0,0,"2016-09-17T18:05:50","Datawych","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>I was run over then reversed back over by two white males who I didn't know. All because I wouldn't talk to them.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/v/thathappened\">v/ThatHappened</a></p>"]]
